<title>UK: Bass Holiday Inn head retires as director.</title>
<headline>Bass Holiday Inn head retires as director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British brewer-to-leisure group Bass Plc said on Friday that Holiday Inn chairman Bryan Langton had retired as a director of the group.</p>
<p>Langton, 60, will remain as chairman of the hotels arm until a successor is announced, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
